{title: Tik Tik Wajate Dokyat}
{artist: Duniyadari Sonu Nigam}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]tik tik vajate [A#]doky [C]aat,        [A#]dhad dhad vadhate [F]thokyat
[F]kadhi [Gm]june [F]kadhi [Gm]navi,        [F]sampate aantar [Gm]zokyat
[Dm]naahi kadhi [A#]sari tari,        [Gm]bhijate ang [C]pany [F]ane
[Dm]sochu tumhe [A#]palbhar bhi,        [Gm]barase sawan [C]jom [F]ane
[F]shimpalya [Gm]che [F]show pees [Gm]nako,        [F]jiv aadakala [Gm]motyat
[F]tik tik vajate [A#]doky [C]aat,        [A#]dhad dhad vadhate [F]thokyat
[Dm]sur hi tu [A#]taal hi tu,        [Gm]ruthe jo chand wo [C]noor hai [F]tu
[Dm]aasu hi tu [A#]hasu hi tu,        [Gm]odhe manachi ni [C]hurhur [F]tu
[F]roj [Gm]nave [F]bhas [Gm]tuje,        [F]vadhate antar [Gm]swasat
[F]tik tik vajate [A#]doky [C]aat,        [A#]dhad dhad vadhate [F]thokyat
